    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are proud to present 44 Villiers Road, Rathgar, Dublin 6 to the market. A most attractive red brick bay windowed period house c. 1765 Sq. Ft./ 164 Sq. M.\r\n\r\nExcellently cared for over many years by its present owner, full of natural light with a wonderful layout and original features throughout. Including marble mantlepieces, ceiling cornice and centre roses, picture and dado rails etc. With all brick exterior and set in well-stocked secluded gardens\r\nwith door to rear lane.\r\n\r\nMuch sought after location beside local shops on Upper Rathmines Road, Rathmines and Rathgar villages, a wide selection of primary and secondary schools including Kildare Place, Scoil Bhríde, St. Mary’s, The High School, Alexandra College, and Gonzaga. The property is beside Palmerston Park, bus routes and Cowper LUAS.\r\n\r\nBriefly comprising hall with ceiling cornice and centre rose, 2 reception rooms with matching marble mantlepieces, ceiling cornice, and centre roses.\r\n\r\nOn the return is a breakfast room with original range and door to kitchen with a range of units. \r\n\r\nOn the first floor return, bedroom 1 with cast iron mantlepiece. Bathroom with bath, W.C., wash hand basin. On the first floor, bedroom 2 with marble mantlepiece and ceiling cornice. Bedroom 3 with marble mantlepiece, bay window, ceiling cornice. There is a stairs to attic room with 3x Velux windows.\r\n\r\nOutside is a railed front garden, rear garden with shrubs, trees, hedging. Door to lane."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nStained glass door. Ceiling cornice and centre rose. Dado rail.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nMarble mantlepiece with cast iron and tiled insert and heart. Ceiling cornice and centre rose. Picture rail. Bay window, stained timber floor. Folding doors to\r\n\r\nDining room\r\nMarble mantlepiece with tiled insert and hearth. Ceiling cornice and centre rose. Picture rail. Shelving. Glazed doors to rear.\r\n\r\nBreakfast Room\r\nOriginal range with brick surround. Tiled floor. Hot press, door to side.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nRange of units, sink unit, extractor. Plumbed for washing machine. 3x Velux windows. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\n1st floor return\r\nBedroom 1\r\nCast iron mantlepiece.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nStand-alone cast iron bath, W.C., wash hand basin, shower. Tiled.\r\n\r\n1st floor\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear)\r\nMarble mantlepiece with cast iron and tiled inserts. Ceiling cornice. Stained timber floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front)\r\nMarble mantlepiece with cast iron and tiled insert and hearth. Ceiling cornice and centre rose. Alcove shelving. Bay window. Stained timber floor.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nStained glass window. Stairs to\r\n\r\nAttic Room\r\n3x Velux windows. Recessed lights, eaves storage.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nRailed front garden. Rear garden with southerly aspect in lawn, walled with hedging, shrubs, trees. Door to lane."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
